            <ArticleTitle>Assembly of BODIPY-carbazole dyes with liposomes to fabricate fluorescent nanoparticles for lysosomal bioimaging in living cells.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c6an02705a</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two BODIPY-carbazole dye based fluorescent probes BCA and BCAS were designed, synthesized and encapsulated by liposomes to obtain fluorescent nanoparticles BCA-FNP and BCAS-FNP. The fluorescence imaging showed that BCA-FNP was membrane-permeable and capable of localizing lysosomes in living cells.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
